    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1/ Screening of childrenl &lt;5 years old by MUAC and WH)  at  clinic site  and at community level by the CHWs.  2/ Active case finding and defaulter/absentee tracing and home visits for children  with stagnant/recent loss of weight by CHWs.</narrative>
    </description>
    <reference code="NUT-I2" indicator-uri="https://dutchrelief.org/" vocabulary="99"></reference>
    <baseline iso-date="2021-12-21" value="0" year="2021">
