     <period-end iso-date="2022-06-21"></period-end>
     <target value="260">
      <dimension name="Age" value="Under 18"></dimension>
      <dimension name="Sex" value="Female"></dimension>
     </target>
     <actual value="269">
      <dimension name="Age" value="Under 18"></dimension>
      <dimension name="Sex" value="Female"></dimension>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">487 children were, in total, admitted and treated by the combination of the mobile clinics and the 4 supported Health Centres. Practically On target with 97.4% of target achieved. The cure rate scored a 96.5% value, which is &gt; 75% minimum SPHERE standard. The defaulter rate was 3.5% (much less than the 15% minimum SPHERE standard), which reflects the good cooperation of mothers and family carers in the monitoring and compliance of SAM children. The death rate and non-respondent rate were at 0%.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
